  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Ka2hKB.png\" alt=\"YUNG&#x27;s Better Dungeons\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需要 YUNG&#x27;s API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG GANG！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上關注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的 YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gf4exw0.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;前所未有的 Minecraft 地牢全面重製。YUNG's Better Dungeons 不僅重新設計了原版地牢，還新增了三個全新地牢：<strong>地下墓穴、不死要塞與蜘蛛洞穴！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.19.2 引入了下界更新！</strong>現在你可以在下界各處找到小型的下界地牢。<strong>注意這是額外可選功能</strong>，意味著你需要在模組設定檔中手動啟用它。</p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1gBQ8gCs4tU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JR6R3uf.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Better Dungeons 旨在與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-caves-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n<li>Repurposed Structures。RS 還提供了一個自訂資料包，你可以與該模組搭配使用，為 Better Dungeons 中的小型地牢增添再利用版本！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-better-dungeons-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此查看。</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每個獨立地牢均可透過設定檔或資料包進行微調。你也可以在設定檔中啟用原版地牢，使其與 Better Dungeons 一同生成。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用折扣碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 於 Bisect Hosting 可享 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
